@startuml
title Discharge decision rule: how each rule/equation is covered

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
  DiamondBorderColor #1F2937
  DiamondFontColor #111827
}

start
:A rewrite rule, structural\nequation, or guard\n(from the language inventory); <<#DBEAFE>>

if (Is the matching AMBIGUOUS\nand is there NO host layer\nto preserve that ambiguity?) then (yes)
  :**IN-ENGINE**\n`AcApp` lazy e-graph matching\n(Ambient `In`/`Out`/`OpenRule`); <<#FEF3C7>>
  note right
    Weight ORDERS the alternatives;
    nothing is pruned. The only
    family that goes in-engine.
  end note
else (no — disposition it)
  if (Deterministic native fold?\n(arithmetic, casts, length, ...)) then (yes)
    :**NativeHandler**\nnative Rust fold\n(root-only exact-key report); <<#DCFCE7>>
  elseif (Process COMM / binder /\nsubstitution with a host RSpace?) then (yes)
    :**RhoNativeJoin**\nexecute on the host Rho machine\n(ambiguity preserved at RSpace); <<#FCE7F3>>
  elseif (Pure congruence rule?\n(equal children give equal parents)) then (yes)
    :**DovetailCoreStructural**\ne-graph congruence closure\n(no explicit rule emitted); <<#EDE9FE>>
  elseif (Guard classifiable by\nan evidence quality tier?) then (yes)
    :**Guard disposition**\nExactDecidable / BoundedDecidable /\nRejectSafeApprox / TrustedNativeGuard; <<#BFDBFE>>
  else (unclassifiable)
    :**Unknown** -> flip gate\n**FAILS CLOSED**\n(language stays un-flipped); <<#FEE2E2>>
  endif
endif
stop

legend right
|= Color |= Disposition |
|<#FEF3C7> | in-engine AC (ambiguous and host-less) |
|<#DCFCE7> | NativeHandler (native fold) |
|<#FCE7F3> | RhoNativeJoin (host RSpace) |
|<#EDE9FE> | e-graph congruence closure |
|<#BFDBFE> | guard disposition (by quality tier) |
|<#FEE2E2> | Unknown gives fail closed (un-flipped) |
endlegend
@enduml
